Package: praatfan
Title: Praat-Compatible Acoustic Analysis
Version: 0.1.9
Authors@R: person("praatfan contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                   email = "noreply@example.com")
Description: R interface to praatfan, a clean-room reimplementation of
    Praat's core acoustic analysis algorithms. Computes pitch (F0),
    formants (Burg LPC), intensity, harmonicity (HNR), spectral moments,
    and band energy with values validated frame-by-frame against Praat.
    Uses a native Rust backend (the praatfan-open-pipe binary) with no
    Python dependencies. Reads WAV, FLAC, MP3, OGG, and NIST SPHERE audio.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.0
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
